      "quote": "Articles were included if they: • Were published in a peer-review journal • Were primary research • Had explicit research design and data collection methods • Had an explicit theoretical ­ approach a for sustainability ­ (theory b , ­ model c , ­ framework d , ­ instrument e , method, checklist, process, strategy, conceptual- izations, development, pilot test and/or ­ tool f ) • Were within a healthcare ­ setting g • Evaluated the sustainability of an EBI",
