      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The manuscript describes the data extraction and analysis process (e.g., identifying approaches, sustainability outcomes), but it does not explicitly specify how studies were grouped for synthesis (e.g., by study design, by theoretical approach, or by outcome type) in relation to the review objectives."
    },
    {
